effect.updates_changelog.text_0=• Full remake for Minecraft Bedrock 1.26.60+ (Android & Windows)
effect.updates_changelog.text_1=• Works WITHOUT Holiday Creator Features or any experimental toggles!
effect.updates_changelog.text_2=• Restored all 38 swords, bosses, custom ores (including Deepslate & End), Desert Well wishes, 3D animations & Inventory red-sword Encyclopedia button
effect.updates_changelog.text_3=• Audited & verified all projectiles, air-swing attacks, Shulker shell, Nether Living Flames, Jungle fishing, and Bedrock-shattering explosions
